        {
          "text": "Ungadli phakathi kwamasango akho okweshumi kukakolweni wakho, nokwewayini lakho, noma kwamafutha akho, namazibulo ezinkomo zakho noma ezimvu zakho, nanoma yisiphi isithembiso sakho osithembisayo, noma iminikelo yakho yesihle noma iminikelo yakho yesihle. Hhayi. Umnikelo wesandla sakho:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.17"
            ]
