              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kepha uyakukudlela phambi kukaJehova uNkulunkulu wakho endaweni uJehova uNkulunkulu wakho ayakuyikhetha, wena nendodana yakho, nendodakazi yakho, nenceku yakho, nencekukazi yakho, nomLevi osemasangweni akho; uthokoze phambi kukaJehova uNkulunkulu wakho ngakho konke obeka izandla zakho kukho.",
          "type": "text",
