          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumelwe ulungise iminikelo yakho yokushiswa, inyama negazi e-altare likaJehova uNkulunkulu wakho; igazi lemihlatshelo yakho kumelwe lithululwe e-altare likaJehova uNkulunkulu wakho, futhi kumelwe uyidle inyama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
