            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qaphela ukuthi ungacutshwa ngokuzilandela ngemva kokuba sezichithiwe phambi kwakho; futhi ungabuzi konkulunkulu bazo, uthi: Lezi zizwe zabakhonza kanjani onkulunkulu bazo? Nami ngizokwenza okufanayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.30"
            ]
          }
        }
